Package: n5-fangov
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: lm-sensors, systemd
Recommends: smartmontools
Conflicts: n5-fand
Maintainer: SirRenix <sirrenix@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SirRenix/n5-fangov
Description: guarded fan control for Proxmox VE and Debian
 Single static daemon that regulates hwmon pwm channels from temperature
 curves with slew limiting, critical override, stall detection, read-back
 verification and a profile-defined safe state on stop. Hardware-verified on
 the Minisforum N5 Pro (IT5571 EC via minisforum_n5_it5571); generic NCT67xx
 and IT87xx profiles ship untested. Includes CLI, HTTP API and web UI.
